/* advc.002b: New file replacing Civ4.thm. There should be a way to use the
   Civ4Theme_....thm files in the BtS/Resource/Themes/Civ4 folder instead -
   I'm only modifying Civ4Theme_Common.thm. Can't figure out how, and
   other mods also copy all those files. At least I've gotten rid of the
   copied tga files. */

/* <!-- custom: AdvCiv-SAS Mod rename: these are startup filesystem paths tied to the installed folder, not the branded [CONFIG] Name from the mod INI; update them manually if the installed mod folder is renamed. See KI#110.2. (ChatGPT-5.6-Sol + GPT-6.1-Sol) --> */
resource_path "Mods\AdvCiv-SAS\Resource";
/* For some obscure reason, the includes in Civ4Theme.thm can't be moved here
   - both Civ4.thm and Civ4Theme.thm are necessary. */
include "Mods\AdvCiv-SAS\Resource\Civ4Theme.thm";